WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.769
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.403
And now if you don't mind,
everybody,

00:00:04.403 --> 00:00:05.838
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:08.341
Republican leader Kevin McCarthy
over the weekend

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:12.345
was elected the 55th Speaker
of the House of Representatives.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.813
And when I say over the weekend,

00:00:14.813 --> 00:00:16.983
I mean over the...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:19.251
It took 15 rounds of voting

00:00:19.251 --> 00:00:21.821
before McCarthy
finally secured the position.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:23.856
They chose McCarthy the same way

00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:26.392
you'd choose Thai food
on New Year's Day.

00:00:26.392 --> 00:00:28.094
"You guys want Thai?

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:30.196
Well, nothing else is open."

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.298
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.700
Ahead of the last round
of voting for House Speaker,

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:38.103
Alabama Congressman Mike Rogers
appeared to charge

00:00:38.103 --> 00:00:40.807
at fellow Republican
Representative Matt Gaetz,

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.575
and, out of habit, Gaetz yelled,

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.744
"I've never even met
your daughter!"

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:47.880
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.782
President Biden
traveled yesterday

00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:51.484
to the U.S./Mexico border

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:54.119
and was met at the airport
by Texas Governor Greg Abbott,

00:00:54.119 --> 00:00:57.056
'cause if there's one way
to show someone you hate them,

00:00:57.056 --> 00:00:59.926
it's to make them
pick you up at the airport.

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:02.295
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:03.996
After spending time
with his family

00:01:03.996 --> 00:01:05.965
in the U.S. Virgin Islands
over the holidays,

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.267
President Biden is reportedly
planning to announce

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:09.635
he will run for reelection

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:13.172
because nothing reminds you
how much you love your job

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:15.675
like some holiday time
with the family.

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:17.610
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.879
In a post on Truth Social
over the weekend,

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.614
former President Trump said
that he helped

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.516
House Speaker Kevin McCarthy
get elected.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:26.285
Dude, he lost 14 times in a row.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:28.955
That's --
It's just not a great brag.

00:01:28.955 --> 00:01:30.323
That's like saying

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:32.758
you helped
get Jurassic Park reopened.

00:01:32.758 --> 00:01:34.493
All right.

00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:38.164
But, like, we can't consider
that a success.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:40.233
Russian President Vladimir Putin
on Friday

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.168
attended a Christmas Eve mass

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.871
at a Russian Orthodox Church
alone.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:46.105
It happens to the best of us.

00:01:46.105 --> 00:01:47.873
You know, one day you look
around and realize

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:50.276
that all your friends
have been pushed out a window.

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:53.846
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:56.649
[ Laughter
and scattered applause ]

00:01:56.649 --> 00:01:59.685
And you'll have
a merry Christmas, anyway.

00:01:59.685 --> 00:02:01.754
A new law is set
to take event in -- Sorry.

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:05.524
A new law is set to take effect
in Connecticut tomorrow

00:02:05.524 --> 00:02:07.961
that allows the sale
of recreational cannabis

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:10.396
where it will be smoked
by the only people

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:11.965
who actually call it cannabis.

00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:13.232
"Ooh!"

00:02:13.232 --> 00:02:15.902
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:19.072
"James, a cannabis cigarette."

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:22.141
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:23.876
"Do we dare?"

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:27.080
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:30.549
By the way, fair warning to
anyone who plans on partaking.

00:02:30.549 --> 00:02:33.886
Don't think too hard
about the word "Connecticut."

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:36.122
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:41.327
[ Laughter continues ]

00:02:45.998 --> 00:02:47.133
[ Laughter continues ]

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:48.468
Connect-icut?

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:49.935
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:49.935 --> 00:02:52.472
A group of whale watchers
off the coast of California

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:55.374
recently saw a gray whale
give birth to a calf

00:02:55.374 --> 00:02:57.043
right next to their boat,

00:02:57.043 --> 00:03:00.279
and then again whenever they
close their eyes from now on.

00:03:00.279 --> 00:03:03.616
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:05.584
And finally, Delta Air Lines
announced last week

00:03:05.584 --> 00:03:08.454
that, next month, it will begin
offering customers free Wi-Fi.

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:11.057
Meanwhile, Spirit is offering
to show customers

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:12.925
how to write "BOOBS"
on a calculator.

00:03:12.925 --> 00:03:15.227
[ Laughter ]
And that...

00:03:15.227 --> 00:03:17.163
[ Cheers and applause ]
...was the monologue, everybody.

00:03:17.163 --> 00:03:19.232
We've got a great show
for you tonight.

